      "id": "PR_kwDODjvEJM68yPz8",
      "title": "feat: move feature compatibility validation to Features lib",
      "author": "maurelian",
      "number": 18752,
      "body": "**Description**\r\n\r\nThis is a baby step towards centralizing feature compatibility validation within a single library.\r\n\r\nIt does not attempt to be general or easily expandable, but our use case is very simple at the moment: we just have two features that need to be kept separate.\r\n\r\nIt also doesn't attempt to handle compatibility between DevFeatures and SystemFeatures. ",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/optimism",
